      "en": "The border shall turn about from Azmon to the brook of Egypt, and it shall end at the sea.",
      "ko": "아스몬에서 돌아서 애굽 시내를 지나 바다까지 이르느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "5063972d86fea80acd60825c80ba0ec8b2f3d16c2edb293e4f2e9ffe1d16265e",
      "translation_text_hash": "52ab1a7f03a8e9811216739a714cbbde92124015d1345079052dca9b7330f8cf",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
