      "en": "“‘This shall be your north border: from the great sea you shall mark out for yourselves Mount Hor.",
      "ko": "북편 경계는 이러하니 대해에서부터 호르산까지 긋고",
      "source_text_hash": "7af4054aa97021497344fe09db9edcf7c28922424c696036ba15cd759a1a46c0",
      "translation_text_hash": "1775caaba813ec74ba78020fea686a36d405b5b442371351b8b7ceb02eab27ad",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "북편 경계는 이러하니 대해에서부터 호르산까지 긋고"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "1775caaba813ec74ba78020fea686a36d405b5b442371351b8b7ceb02eab27ad"
      ]
    },
    {
